<title>NIGER: Niger army plane crashes, 13 dead.</title>
<headline>Niger army plane crashes, 13 dead.</headline>
<dateline>NIAMEY 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Niger army transport plane on a flight from Togo crashed as it prepared to land on Wednesday killing at least 13 people on board, military sources said.</p>
<p>The plane, a Hercules C130, crashed near the village of Sorei about 12 km (eight miles) east of the impoverished West African nation's capital Niamey, the sources added.</p>
<p>Earlier, state radio said the plane crashed shortly after takeoff. The total number of people on board the plane was not immediately known.</p>
